				<skos:narrower rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/2/concepts/501578" />
				<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This is the top term for the class covering objects associated with cultivation, the rearing of livestock, gathering, hunting, fishing, horticulture and the primary processing of foodstuffs. See AGRICULTURE AND SUBSISTENCE (OBJECT) Class List for narrow terms.</skos:scopeNote>
