					</skos:Concept>
				</skos:narrower>
				<skos:narrower rdf:resource="http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/2/concepts/502809" />
				<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This is the top term for the class covering objects which serve as vessels. This class includes containers for which the function is either specific or unknown. Where the function is known, the term is also included within another class, eg churn. See CONTAINER Class List for narrow terms.</skos:scopeNote>
