					</skos:Concept>
				</skos:narrower>
				<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This is the top term for the class covering objects primarily intended to be used as a medium of exchange, eg coins. See CURRENCY Class List for narrow terms.</skos:scopeNote>
