				<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">This is the top term for the class covering clothes, items of attire and ornament and objects for personal use by individuals, including toiletries. See DRESS AND PERSONAL ACCESSORIES Class List for narrow terms.</skos:scopeNote>
