						<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Pottery sherd or sherds that cannot be identified with a specific vessel type. Use more specific term for vessel type where possible. Use when the text description does not allow for more precise classification. For a scatter of pottery sherds, use POTTERY SCATTER from the Monument thesaurus.</skos:scopeNote>
