						<skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Flint that cannot be identified as a tool, weapon, debitage or natural occurrence. Use more specific term where possible. Use when the text description does not allow for more precise classification. For a natural accumulation of flint use FLINT DEPOSIT from the Monument thesaurus. For a scatter of flint objects, use FLINT SCATTER from the Monument thesaurus.</skos:scopeNote>
